{"id":"enchant-lsmod.1","n":"enchant-lsmod","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"enchant","ver":"1.6.0-30.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/e/enchant-1.6.0-30.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/enchant-lsmod.1.gz","sha256":"9856037a6491beb254a0e3d460ff52c232cdaf205064cfd2d3871af683a3b009","date":"July 2006","origin":"enchant"}},"nopt":{"r":4},"desc":"list provider and dictionary information","r":[["NAME","<p>enchant-lsmod - list provider and dictionary information</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>enchant-lsmod</b> [<b>-lang [</b><b>language_tag</b>]] [<b>-list-dicts</b>] [<b>-h</b>] [<b>-v</b>]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>enchant-lsmod</b> gives information about Enchant's spell-checker providers and the dictionaries each offers.</p>  <h3>OPTIONS</h3> <dl><dt data-o=\"\" data-g=\"OPTIONS\"><b>-lang [language_tag]</b></dt><dd>Lists information about user's language if no <i>language_tag</i> is given, or about that <i>language_tag</i>.</dd><dt data-o=\"\" data-g=\"OPTIONS\"><b>-list-dicts</b></dt><dd>Lists installed dictionaries.</dd><dt data-o=\"\" data-g=\"OPTIONS\"><b>-h</b></dt><dd>Prints a brief usage information.</dd><dt data-o=\"\" data-g=\"OPTIONS\"><b>-v</b></dt><dd>Prints the program's version.</dd></dl>"],["MORE INFORMATION","<p>http://www.abisource.com/enchant/</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>enchant(1)</b></p>"],["AUTHOR","<br> <p>Dom Lachowicz <br> WEB: http://www.abisource.com/enchant/ <br> MAIL: domlachowicz@gmail.com</p>"]]}